he Department of Sociology."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 641, "end": 727, "text": "During his tenure, he collaborated with prominent scholars in the field, including Dr."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 728, "end": 778, "text": "Emily Chen, a leading expert on social inequality."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 779, "end": 883, "text": "In 2015, Feng was appointed as an assistant professor in the Department of Sociology at Yale University."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 884, "end": 1059, "text": "His research at Yale centered on the impact of social capital on economic outcomes, with a particular focus on the role of educational institutions in shaping social networks."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1060, "end": 1075, "text": "Notable Studies"}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1077, "end": 1197, "text": "One of Feng's most notable studies during his time at Yale was published in the journal Social Science Research in 2017."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1198, "end": 1413, "text": "The study, titled \"Social Capital and Economic Mobility: A Comparative Analysis of Educational Institutions,\" examined the relationship between social capital and economic outcomes in different educational settings."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1414, "end": 1562, "text": "The study's findings suggested that educational institutions play a crucial role in shaping social networks, which in turn affect economic mobility."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1563, "end": 1687, "text": "Another significant study conducted by Feng during his time at Yale was published in the journal Sociological Forum in 2019."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1688, "end": 1875, "text": "The study, titled \"The Impact of Social Networks on Labor Market Outcomes: A Longitudinal Analysis,\" explored the relationship between social networks and labor market outcomes over time."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1876, "end": 2040, "text": "The study's findings indicated that social networks have a significant impact on labor market outcomes, particularly for individuals from disadvantaged backgrounds."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2041, "end": 2051, "text": "References"}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2053, "end": 2063, "text": "* Feng, S."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2064, "end": 2071, "text": "(2017)."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2072, "end": 2161, "text": "Social Capital and Economic Mobility: A Comparative Analysis of Educational Institutions."}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2162, "end": 2199, "text": "Social Science Research, 65, 123-135."}, "D2S26": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2200, "end": 2210, "text": "* Feng, S."}, "D2S27": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2211, "end": 2218, "text": "(2019)."}, "D2S28": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2219, "end": 2299, "text": "The Impact of Social Networks on Labor Market Outcomes: A Longitudinal Analysis."}, "D2S29": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2300, "end": 2335, "text": "Sociological Forum, 34(2), 341-356."}, "D2S30": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2336, "end": 2358, "text": "* Chen, E., & Feng, S."}, "D2S31": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2359, "end": 2366, "text": "(2016)."}, "D2S32": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2367, "end": 2429, "text": "Social Inequality and Educational Outcomes: A Critical Review."}, "D2S33": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2430, "end": 2470, "text": "Annual Review of Sociology, 42, 347-363."}}, "candidates": [], "original_car